<title>USA: Bon-Ton Stores Aug same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Bon-Ton Stores Aug same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $46.5	$41.6	+11.8	+7.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $306.6     $296.1	 +3.5	+1.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentages.</p>
<p>    Month is  four   weeks ended Aug 31.</p>
<p>Full company name is  Bon-Ton Stores Inc.</p>
